%%% note
由来: mulet test/mulet/url_test.clj:63 (parseURI-test)
testing: Opaque URI (mailto)
元の形: url/parseURI の直接呼び出しを DW に書き換え
mulet: 成功
%%% script
%dw 2.0
import parseURI from dw::core::URL
output application/json
---
parseURI("mailto:user@example.com")
%%% output application/json
{
  "isValid": true,
  "raw": "mailto:user@example.com",
  "scheme": "mailto",
  "isAbsolute": true,
  "isOpaque": true
}
